Legal finance ai tasks that can be delegated
title end

paragraph start
Tasks that suit AI: summarising a public rule so a person can read the source, drafting checklists, formatting records and sending deadline reminders. Tasks that stay with a person: legal and tax decisions, signing, filing and any statement of what the law requires.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Delegate only a task with a clear input, a clear output and a check a person can do quickly.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
task, delegate or keep, input, output, check
code end

